# Deliberately wrong: the RUN returns column `x`, the expectation says
# `y`. bolt_compat.rs replays this script and asserts the failure report
# names this file and the line of the wrong expectation. It lives outside
# scripts/, so the corpus run never picks it up.
!: BOLT 4.4
!: AUTO HELLO
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: RUN "RETURN 1 AS x" {} {}
S: SUCCESS {"fields": ["y"]}
